# A sweep held to a direction through a corner between two lines: the
# rectangle of sweep_corner.tlspr swept along its two lines, then its
# frames held to y, the corner's axis, on the group's screen, which makes
# it fitted; the corner is mitred as before, and the solid is checked.
file $testdata/ui/sweep_corner.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view other
click-entity 40000
click-entity 50000
menu Features|Sweep Along Path
twmove 346 225
twdown L 346 225
twup L 346 225
tw
menu Analyze|Check Solid
dump
